Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.03,0:23:04.49,Encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\bord0\c&H5748B2&\4a&HFF&\an8}Fiction, Non-fiction{フィクション / ノンフィクション}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.49,0:23:07.29,Encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\bord0\c&H5748B2&\4a&HFF&\an8}Dentro delas pode haver realidade{事実も中にはあるかもしれない？}{Fato... Verdade... Realidade... Não sei qual encaixaria melhor }
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.29,0:23:09.71,Encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\bord0\c&H5748B2&\4a&HFF&\an8}Fiction, Non-fiction{フィクション / ノンフィクション}
